      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. it feels pretty strong. i want to lean even harder into the idea that people who choose not to vote are actually letting their neighbors down. like, if you don't vote, you're basically being selfish by letting someone else make decisions for your entire community. can you add a section that addresses people who say 'there's no good choice so why bother' and basically shut that down? make it clear that their inaction is actually a form of harm to everyone else.",
